          "Do not set this adoption data freshness result beside an external benchmark unless definitions and populations match. A local rate speaks only for the cases sampled in that window. CustomerSuccessManagers labels it local evidence and records the date it was produced. That label keeps a small finding from being stretched into a claim it cannot carry. Write the field name rather than a description of the field, so the extract and the note use the same vocabulary.",
          "A useful finding changes one decision the team can name in advance. If the result would not alter a review, a queue rule, or an escalation, the review is measuring curiosity. CustomerSuccessManagers writes the intended decision beside the measure before collection begins. That one sentence stops a tidy report from replacing action. Leave the exception visible in the queue until an accountable owner has accepted the next action."
